1155:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * as well as the available options size.
1156:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  *
1157:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * @param pcb tcp_pcb
1158:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * @param optlen the length of other TCP options (in bytes)
1159:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * @return the number of SACK ranges that can be used
